,"kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #10: Bat Wall Mount & Shop Expansion License","summary":"Hello, bookies! ⚾ A smaller update this time, starting with something for the shop's walls. A place for your batYour baseball bat usually ends up lying on the floor or leaning against the counter. Now it can go on the wall. The Bat Wall Mount is in the tablet shop under Furniture, next to the stands. Put it on any wall, look at it with the bat in your hand and hang the bat. With an empty hand you can take it down again whenever a thief walks in. The bat stays on the mount when you save and load,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:24:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039118","verified_at":"2026-10-24T10:28:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1847286114028882","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #9: IRON CAGE Fight Night & Night Edition","summary":"Hello, bookies! 🥊 This one starts with something new on the TVs. IRON CAGE is hereEvery evening at 18:00 the BS CAGE channel goes live. Eight fighters walk into the cage at the same time. There are no rounds and no rules, and the last one standing takes the belt. Expect chairs, someone climbing a ladder to jump on a pile of fighters, and a lot of people lying on the floor by the end of the night. Tune any TV in your shop to BS CAGE and watch it with your customers. You can watch the fights in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:36:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028882","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:51:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846651706687071","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #8: Odds Formats & Stacking Boxes","summary":"Hello, bookies! ⚽ A smaller update this time, and most of it comes straight from your messages. New in the demoOdds formats: decimal, fractional or American. Stacking boxes: put a box right on top of another one. Leave a review: a new button on the main menu.Odds the way you're used to reading themNot everyone reads odds as 2.50. There's a new Odds format option in the settings, both on the main menu and on your tablet: Decimal: 2.50 Fractional: 6/4, the way UK and Irish bookies show it American","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:18:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846651706680512","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"announcement","title":"We're in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ Some news: Bet Shop Simulator will be part of Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26. The festival kicks off on October 19 at 10 AM PT, and the demo will be on the festival pages for the whole week. If you haven't played the demo yet, now's a good time. You take over a boarded-up betting shop: tear the newspapers off the windows, clean the place up and put your own name on the sign. Then the customers start coming in. You scan their slips, count out the change, and when football,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:04:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846651706676469","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #7: Card Dealer & Single Cards","summary":"Hello, bookies! ⚽ This update is all about cards, plus a shop that sounds a lot more alive on match nights. New in the demoCard Dealer: a visitor who sells you cards, if you can agree on a price. Single Card Counter: sell your spare cards one by one. Shipping from the Collection: pick the cards you want to sell and they arrive in a box. Match reactions: customers cheer and groan while they watch. Card Dealer: haggle for a cardEvery few minutes a card dealer walks in, finds a quiet corner and wai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:06:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067944412","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #6: Your Feedback, Fixed","summary":"Thank you, bookies! ⚽ Since the demo went live we have received 75+ pieces of feedback. We read every single one of them, one by one, and turned them into a roadmap. We will be sharing that roadmap with you very soon. We also had 41 of you in the shop at the same time. For a team our size that number means a lot. Thank you. We hope you are having fun running your shop. This update is made almost entirely of things you told us about. Keep it coming on our Discord server, we read it all: https://d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:18:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067939835","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"announcement","title":"2,000 Wishlists: Thank You!","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ Bet Shop Simulator has passed 2,000 wishlists. We celebrated inside the game: derby day, a packed shop, a goal, and a message for you up on the sign. Thank you to everyone who wishlisted the game, played the demo, reported a bug or shared an idea. Every wishlist helps Steam show the game to more players, and for a small team that means a lot. Haven't tried it yet? The demo is out on Steam and it's free. Take over a boarded-up betting shop, print slips, run the register and watch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T02:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067937985","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #5: Calendar & Collection","summary":"Thank you, bookies! ⚽ Thank you for playing the demo, for every wishlist, and for telling us what you want to see next. We're doing everything we can to give you more, and this time that means new mechanics: two new apps on your tablet and a new way to start the day. Keep the feedback coming on our Discord server, we read it all: https://discord.gg/v8ZdFdyBPuNew in the demoCalendar: plan your days at the shop. Collection: collect and complete your sets. Both are waiting on your tablet's home scr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:12:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937985","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067937152","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #4: You Asked, We Fixed","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ Since the demo went live, more than 80 of you have followed the game and more than 500 of you have added it to your wishlist. Thank you. For a small team, that support means a lot, and we're doing everything we can to give you more. This update comes straight from what you told us. Every change below started as feedback from a player. Keep it coming on our Discord server, we read it all: https://discord.gg/v8ZdFdyBPu Now, on to what's new. Customers walk on the ground nowCustome","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T19:44:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937152","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067936388","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #3: More FPS, Same Look","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ The demo has only just opened its doors and you've already made our week: on day one, more than 1.7k of you added the demo to your library, more than 900 players rolled up the shutters, and 38 bookies were behind the counter at the same time. For a small team, those numbers mean a lot. Some of you told us the game runs slower than it should on your PC. This update is for you: it's all about performance. We're doing everything we can to make the game better. Tell us anything that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:19:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067935927","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #2: Smoother Match Days","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ The demo has only just opened its doors and you've already made our week: on day one, more than 1,500 of you added the demo to your library, more than 800 players rolled up the shutters, and 33 bookies were behind the counter at the same time. For a small team, those numbers mean a lot. To everyone who played, left a comment, reported a bug or shared an idea: thank you. We read every piece of feedback. This update fixes rough edges we spotted ourselves and problems you told us a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:37:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935927","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067935398","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #1: Cats on Patrol!","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ The demo has only just opened its doors and you've already made our week: on day one, more than 1,000 of you added the demo to your library, more than 500 players rolled up the shutters, and 33 bookies were behind the counter at the same time. For a small team, those numbers mean a lot. To everyone who played, left a comment, reported a bug or shared an idea: thank you. We read every piece of feedback. This update fixes rough edges we spotted ourselves and adds new features you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T05:14:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935398","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3854680-1846018067932996","game_id":"steam-3854680","kind":"announcement","title":"Bet Shop Simulator Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hello bookies! ⚽ The day is here: Bet Shop Simulator demo is out now on Steam, and it's free. Your turn to flip the sign to OPEN. You take over a boarded-up betting shop. Tear the newspapers off the windows, clear out the trash and put your own name on the sign. Then the real work starts: run the customer's slip through the machine, take the cash and count out the change. Football, Apex GP and horse racing play on your TVs all day,